# Plugin Architecture

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class IPlugin {
        <<interface>>
        +plugin_id: str
        +plugin_name: str
        +version: str
        +register()
        +unregister()
        +on_startup()
        +on_shutdown()
    }

    class IPluginManager {
        <<interface>>
        +register_plugin(plugin)
        +unregister_plugin(id)
        +get_plugin(id)
        +list_plugins()
        +enable_plugin(id)
        +disable_plugin(id)
    }

    class IEventPublisher {
        <<interface>>
        +publish(data, correlation_id, source)
        +publish_many(events)
    }

    class IEventSubscriber {
        <<interface>>
        +subscribe(handler, event_types, patterns)
        +unsubscribe(subscription_id)
    }

    class PluginManager {
        -plugins: Dict
        -registry: EventRegistry
        +register_plugin(plugin)
        +unregister_plugin(id)
        +get_plugin(id)
    }

    class EventEngine {
        +publish(event_data)
        +subscribe(subscriber_id, handler)
    }

    IPlugin <|.. RadioPlugin : implements
    IPlugin <|.. SignalPlugin : implements
    IPlugin <|.. CustomPlugin : implements

    IPluginManager <|.. PluginManager : implements
    IEventPublisher <|.. EventEngine : implements
    IEventSubscriber <|.. EventEngine : implements

    PluginManager --> EventEngine : uses
    EventEngine --> IEventPublisher
    EventEngine --> IEventSubscriber
```

## Plugin Lifecycle

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Registered: register()
    Registered --> Enabled: enable()
    Enabled --> Running: on_startup()
    Running --> Disabled: disable()
    Disabled --> Removed: unregister()
    Running --> Stopped: on_shutdown()
    Stopped --> Removed: unregister()
    Enabled --> Registered: disable()

    Registered --> [*]: Failed
    Enabled --> [*]: Error
```
